#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.rst:2
msgid "Localization"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.Localization:1
msgid "Regroupe les paramètres de détection et d'ajustement des localisations."
msgstr "Retrieves the settings for the fit."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.Localization:3
msgid "Paramètres regroupés :"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.Localization:5
msgid "``Preview`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : active la prévisualisation ; valeur par défaut : ``False``."
msgstr "``Preview`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : enables preview; default value: ``False``."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.Localization:6
msgid "``Threshold`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : seuil d'intensité de la détection ; valeur par défaut : ``90.0``."
msgstr "``Threshold`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : detection intensity threshold; default value: ``90.0``."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.Localization:7
msgid "``Auto Threshold`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Button.Button`) : calcule automatiquement le seuil."
msgstr "``Auto Threshold`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Button.Button`) : automatically computes the threshold."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.Localization:8
msgid "``ROI Shape`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : forme circulaire ou carrée de la zone d'ajustement."
msgstr "``ROI Shape`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : circular or square shape of the fitting region."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.Localization:9
msgid "``ROI Size`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : taille de la zone d'ajustement ; valeur par défaut : ``7`` pixels."
msgstr "``ROI Size`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : size of the fitting region; default value: ``7`` pixels."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.Localization:10
msgid "``Watershed`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : sépare les points voisins ; valeur par défaut : ``True``."
msgstr "``Watershed`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : separates neighboring points; default value: ``True``."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.Localization:11
msgid "``Fit`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : sélectionne l'absence d'ajustement, l'ajustement gaussien ou l'ajustement par spline."
msgstr "``Fit`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : selects no fitting, Gaussian fitting, or spline fitting."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.Localization:12
msgid "``Gaussian Fit`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit`) : paramètres de l'ajustement gaussien."
msgstr "``Gaussian Fit`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit`) : Gaussian-fitting settings."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Localization.Localization:13
msgid "``Spline Fit`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.SplineFit.SplineFit`) : paramètres de l'ajustement par spline."
msgstr "``Spline Fit`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.SplineFit.SplineFit`) : spline-fitting settings."

